http://aburatan.sourceforge.net/fonthack.zip

I hope you don't mind David, I included your font file in the archive.
Say the word and I'll take the file down.  The archive contains:

font.exe     - executable to load
font.cpp     - source
fonthack.bat - batch file that loads the font then loads NetHack
readme       - small file that gives the credit (but no instructions)
linux.fon    - the font file.  Renamed because I compiled with TC3.0
               (which has no LFN support) but otherwise unmodified


To use, unpack into the nethack directory.  You will still need to
redefine the codes for all of the tiles.  I leave this as an excercise
for the user (essentially because I'm lazy :) )

